# Plaintext athlete data never belongs in this repo. These are minors and the
# published site is public regardless of repo visibility. The one roster file that
# does get committed is public/roster.enc, which is ciphertext. See DESIGN.md.
roster*.csv
roster*.txt
roster*.json
/rosters/
*-splits.csv

# The passphrase for public/roster.enc. That file is ciphertext and is meant to
# be committed; this is the thing that must never join it.
*passphrase*

